  "description": "Unified Admin UI + IAM + JWT + Basic Auth + API Keys for multi-tenant Dynamic CRUD API platforms. v1.7.0 opens cross-app handoff links in a new tab, adds a general (non-per-database) SqliteAdmin handoff, lets a Global Admin set/change a database's owning tenant from the Edit modal, and materializes RateLimitAdmin's per-database row immediately on handoff instead of waiting for real traffic. v1.6.0 added a signed cross-app handoff (CrossAppHandoffService) and a plain-string caller-identity bridge so independent add-on packages (e.g. WebSvc.RateLimitAdmin) can offer one-click auto-login and per-request identity without any compiled dependency on this package.",
